OL,3,GNEWSAJeweller dies after robbery at
OL,4,Astore a week ago
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 55-year-old man has died a week after
OL,7,Fbeing seriously injured during a
OL,8,Fviolent robbery at a jewellery store in
OL,9,FPeterborough.
OL,11,FAnsar Mahmood, believed to be the owner
OL,12,Fof Lala Jewellers on Gladstone Street,
OL,13,Fwas attacked when six men targeted the
OL,14,Fshop shortly before midday on Saturday,
OL,15,FCambridgeshire Police said.
OL,17,FMahmood, of Eastfield Road, was taken
OL,18,Fto hospital and died on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
