OL,3,GNEWSAJeweller dies after robbery at
OL,4,Astore a week ago
OL,5,
OL,6,FSubur Ahmed, 20, and Wasim Iqbal, 43,
OL,7,Fboth of Upper Seamore Street in
OL,8,FBradford, appeared at Cambridge
OL,9,FMagistrates' Court earlier on Friday
OL,10,Fcharged with robbery in connection with
OL,11,Fthe incident. They are due back in
OL,12,Fcourt in December.
